# Linked git worktrees (created under .claude/worktrees by Claude Code) are
# nested inside this checkout on disk but are separate git checkouts of their
# own branch. Anchored .prettierignore/.eslintignore patterns above only match
# at THIS root, so without this entry, tools that walk the filesystem (not git
# itself) reach into a linked worktree and reformat/relint its generated
# artifacts as a side effect of running here.
.claude/worktrees/
